    <briefdescription>
<para>A set of parameters used to control various transforms performed by the LoopUnroll pass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each of the boolean parameters can be set to: true - enabling the transformation. false - disabling the transformation. None - relying on a global default.</para>
<para>There is also OptLevel parameter, which is used for additional loop unroll tuning.</para>
<para>Intended use is to create a default object, modify parameters with additional setters and then pass it to <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_loop_unroll_pass" kindref="compound">LoopUnrollPass</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
